---
import WhatsAppButton from './WhatsAppButton.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import reportMoment from '../assets/report-moment.jpg';
---

<section class="section-wrapper section-surface" id="reporte">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="report-layout">
      <!-- Left side: Explanation -->
      <div class="report-content">
        <span class="badge badge-orange">Tranquilidad Total</span>
        <h2 class="report-title">
          Qué recibes después de cada salida con Happy Paws
        </h2>
        <p class="lead">
          Sabemos lo importante que es tu tranquilidad. Al concluir cada paseo en Foresta, te enviamos un reporte conciso y honesto directamente por WhatsApp con el resumen de la salida de tu perro.
        </p>

        <ul class="report-points">
          <li>
            <div class="point-icon-box">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
                <polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong>Hora y duración verificadas</strong>
              <p>Confirmación exacta de cuándo inició la caminata y a qué hora regresó a casa.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="point-icon-box">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path d="M12 2.69l5.66 5.66a8 8 0 1 1-11.31 0z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong>Hidratación y necesidades fisiológicas</strong>
              <p>Registro de pausas para tomar agua fresca y si hizo pipí o popó con normalidad.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="point-icon-box">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong>Comportamiento y nivel de energía</strong>
              <p>Cómo interactuó con el entorno, si disfrutó el olfato o si mostró algún signo de fatiga.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="point-icon-box">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path d="M23 19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4l2-3h6l2 3h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path>
                <circle cx="12" cy="13" r="4"></circle>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong>Fotografía o clip corto (con previa autorización)</strong>
              <p>Una foto espontánea de su momento al aire libre para que veas cómo disfrutó.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <div class="report-cta-box">
          <p class="small-text">
            ¿Quieres probar el servicio con tu perro en Foresta? Platiquemos por WhatsApp para coordinar una primera salida.
          </p>
          <WhatsAppButton
            context="main"
            text="Quiero conocer el servicio"
            variant="whatsapp"
            size="md"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right side: Visual Mockup of the WhatsApp Report Card -->
      <div class="report-mockup-wrapper">
        <div class="phone-frame">
          <div class="phone-speaker-notch" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="chat-header">
            <div class="chat-header-left">
              <svg class="back-icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <polyline points="15 18 9 12 15 6"></polyline>
              </svg>
              <div class="chat-avatar">
                <span>HP</span>
              </div>
              <div class="chat-info">
                <span class="chat-name">Happy Paws • Foresta</span>
                <span class="chat-status">
                  <span class="online-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> en línea
                </span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="chat-header-actions" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <polygon points="23 7 16 12 23 17 23 7"></polygon>
                <rect x="1" y="5" width="15" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
              </svg>
              <svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="chat-bubble">
            <div class="bubble-tag">REPORTE DE PASEO</div>
            
            <div class="bubble-image">
              <Image
                src={reportMoment}
                alt="Perro relajado descansando en pasto durante el paseo"
                loading="lazy"
                widths={[320, 480, 640, 800]}
                sizes="(max-width: 480px) min(calc(100vw - 80px), 330px), 330px"
              />
              <span class="photo-auth-note">Foto enviada con autorización previa</span>
            </div>

            <div class="bubble-details">
              <div class="detail-row">
                <span class="detail-label">Mascota:</span>
                <span class="detail-val">Tu perro</span>
              </div>
              <div class="detail-row">
                <span class="detail-label">Duración:</span>
                <span class="detail-val">45 min (10:00 - 10:45)</span>
              </div>
              <div class="detail-row">
                <span class="detail-label">Ruta:</span>
                <span class="detail-val">Senderos y áreas verdes de Foresta</span>
              </div>
              <div class="detail-row">
                <span class="detail-label">Hidratación:</span>
                <span class="detail-val">2 tomas de agua fresca</span>
              </div>
              <div class="detail-row">
                <span class="detail-label">Necesidades:</span>
                <span class="detail-val">Pipí: Sí • Popó: Sí (recogida)</span>
              </div>
              <div class="detail-notes">
                <strong>Observaciones:</strong> Tu perro estuvo animado y curioso con los olores matutinos. Caminó con correa relajada en todo momento. Quedó descansando con agua fresca llena en casa.
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="bubble-time-row">
              <span class="bubble-time">10:46 AM</span>
              <svg class="wa-ticks" width="16" height="11" viewBox="0 0 16 11" fill="none" aria-label="Entregado y leído">
                <path d="M1 6.5L4.5 10L11 1.5" stroke="#53BDEB" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                <path d="M5.5 6.5L9 10L15.5 1.5" stroke="#53BDEB" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .report-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
    gap: var(--space-12);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .report-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .report-title {
    margin-top: var(--space-1);
    color: var(--color-text-title);
  }

  .report-points {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    margin-top: var(--space-3);
  }

  .report-points li {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .point-icon-box {
    width: 42px;
    height: 42px;
    background-color: var(--color-primary-light);
    color: var(--color-primary);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .report-points strong {
    display: block;
    color: var(--color-text-title);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }

  .report-points p {
    font-size: 0.925rem;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .report-cta-box {
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
    padding: var(--space-6);
    background-color: var(--color-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  .small-text {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  /* Phone Mockup */
  .report-mockup-wrapper {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .phone-frame {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 380px;
    background-color: #EFEAE2;
    border: 9px solid #1C1917;
    border-radius: 40px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow:
      0 24px 60px -10px rgba(28, 25, 23, 0.25),
      0 6px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    position: relative;
  }

  .phone-speaker-notch {
    width: 64px;
    height: 4px;
    background-color: #2E2925;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    margin: 8px auto 6px auto;
  }

  .chat-header {
    background-color: #075E54;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    padding: 10px 14px 12px 14px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .chat-header-left {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .back-icon {
    color: #FFFFFF;
    opacity: 0.85;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .chat-header-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  .online-dot {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    background-color: #25D366;
    border-radius: 50%;
    margin-right: 2px;
    vertical-align: middle;
  }

  .chat-avatar {
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: var(--color-primary-action);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 0.825rem;
    color: #fff;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .chat-info {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .chat-name {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .chat-status {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    opacity: 0.9;
    color: #D1E7DD;
  }

  .chat-bubble {
    background-color: #FFFFFF;
    margin: 14px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 12px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .bubble-tag {
    font-size: 0.725rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--color-primary-text);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .bubble-image {
    width: 100%;
    height: 160px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .bubble-image img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .photo-auth-note {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 6px;
    left: 6px;
    right: 6px;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 0.675rem;
    padding: 3px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .bubble-details {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
    font-size: 0.825rem;
  }

  .detail-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed #EDE8E2;
    padding-bottom: 3px;
  }

  .detail-label {
    color: var(--color-text-subtle);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .detail-val {
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .detail-notes {
    margin-top: 6px;
    background-color: var(--color-bg);
    padding: 8px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .detail-notes strong {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .bubble-time-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    margin-top: 6px;
  }

  .bubble-time {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: #6E665E;
  }

  .wa-ticks {
    display: block;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .report-layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .report-mockup-wrapper {
      order: -1;
    }
  }
</style>
